# beautiful-mermaid on the mermaid.md gallery: it draws the types it supports (flowchart,
# sequence, class, state, ER, XY chart), Pele draws the other 16; each gets the diagram
# buttons; mermaid.js and Google Fonts never load
@ source ../../mermaid.md
@ mermaid beautiful-mermaid
=12 class="beautiful-mermaid"
=16 class="pele-diagram"
=28 class="mdr-diagram"
=28 aria-label="Copy diagram source"
=28 aria-label="Download SVG"
=28 aria-label="Expand diagram"
+ class="pele pele-pie"
+ --bg: #151b23
- class="mdr-diagram-error"
- data-processed
- fonts.googleapis.com
- mermaid.min.js
=1 <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/pele
